Both driver and rider can cancel the order before the ride starts. Orders cancelled by the rider will only affect your Driver Score if you’re not moving to the rider, moving away from the rider or taking excessive amount of time to reach the rider. If the rider rider doesn’t shown up, it doesn’t affect your Driver Score.

